OL,3,GNEWSAPark plan for city's medieval
OL,4,Acastle site delayed
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe opening of a public park on the
OL,7,Fsite of what was once Sheffield's
OL,8,Fmedieval castle will be delayed by
OL,9,Fnearly two years.
OL,11,FCastle Hill Park, which will feature a
OL,12,F500-capacity event space, was due to
OL,13,Fopen this year, but Sheffield Council
OL,14,Fhas now said it will instead take place
OL,15,Fin summer 2028.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,389,380,200,160,0,100
