OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,.*,%%** %  -,** %-. (,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAPark plan for city's medieval
OL,4,Acastle site delayed
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe authority described the project on
OL,7,Fthe former castle site and the newly
OL,8,Funcovered River Sheaf as one of its
OL,9,Fmost "complex", with unexpected finds,
OL,10,Fdesign changes and the involvement of
OL,11,Fnational agencies all contributing to
OL,12,Fdelays.
OL,14,FCouncillor Alexi Dimond said: "While we
OL,15,Fknow people are eager to see the new
OL,16,Fpark completed, we're taking the time
OL,17,Fto respond to the unique challenges
OL,18,Fpresented on the site."
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
